# Meta (Facebook) pixels. Public by nature — they ship in the HTML of every page — but they live
# here so a pixel can be added, swapped or dropped by editing this ONE line, with no code edit.
#
# COMMA-SEPARATED. Every pixel listed is initialised and receives every event. Blank = no script,
# no noscript beacon, no events at all.
#
#   1614877760150035  the pixel the media buyer works on, and the one CAPI reports to
#
# 1611910119460872 (the incumbent from the Vite storefront) was REMOVED 2026-10-10 — owner decision:
# no campaigns or audiences ran on it. To put it back, add it here with a comma and rebuild.
